    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about safety",
     "texto": [
      "**Arbeidsmiljø** is the work environment. **Arbeidsulykke** is a work accident; **rapportere** means to report something officially."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking for permission",
     "texto": [
      "**Få lov til å + infinitive** means to have permission to do something. **Få snakke med** can mean you are allowed to speak with someone."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
